msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"This concludes the basic battle tutorial.\r\n"
"Now show those thugs what you can do!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"The <Color:7>Finishing Blow<Color:Default> is the most powerful unarmed attack\r\n"
"in Kiryu's arsenal. To execute one, press <Action:Battle_Heavy_Attack@Combat> at any point\r\n"
"during a Rush Combo.\r\n"
"What kind of <Color:7>Finishing Blow<Color:Default> you perform depends on\r\n"
"how many times you press <Action:Battle_Normal_Attack@Combat> beforehand. Try mastering each one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"Press <Action:Battle_Dodge@Combat> once to quickly move backwards,\r\n"
"or hold a direction with the <Action:Move_Forward@Combat><Action:Move_Back@Combat><Action:Move_Left@Combat><Action:Move_Right@Combat> and press <Action:Battle_Dodge@Combat> to move in that direction."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"Hold <Action:Battle_Fight_Stance@Combat> to assume a fighting stance.\r\n"
"Use the <Action:Move_Forward@Combat><Action:Move_Back@Combat><Action:Move_Left@Combat><Action:Move_Right@Combat> while in this stance to strafe\r\n"
"around whichever enemy you've locked onto.\r\n"
"This is particularly effective in 1-on-1 fights."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"Hold <Action:Battle_Guard@Combat> to guard yourself against frontal attacks.\r\n"
"However, this does not work against attacks from the rear or side."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2060"
msgid "Tutorial Complete"
msgstr "Tutorial completato"

